My Assessment

I think this is the right place to start, and I'd deliberately leave it in Discovery for now rather than locking it immediately.

Here's why: we've intentionally written it at a high level. As we work through capability discovery, ownership, and analysis, we'll almost certainly discover refinements or additional enterprise problems. Once Discovery is complete, we can return to DF-EP-001, update it to reflect those findings, and then lock it as the authoritative Enterprise Persistence Problem Statement.